---
import SectionEyebrow from './SectionEyebrow.astro'
---

<section id="bridge" class="border-b border-[var(--rule)]">
  <div class="hazard-stripe" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="container-app">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-12 border-x border-[var(--rule)]">
      <!-- Left: Context -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4 cell border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-[var(--rule)] reveal flex flex-col justify-between">
        <div>
          <SectionEyebrow label="Uniting pillar" labelKo="통일의 기둥" code="YSS-01" />
          <h2 class="text-macro frame-bracket text-balance">The Admiral</h2>
          <p class="font-ko text-sm text-[var(--muted)] mt-3">충무공 이순신</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-8 lg:mt-auto">
          <p class="text-sm text-body text-pretty">
            Canonical in Pyongyang. Bronze at Gwanghwamun. One figure both halves of the nation already claim.
          </p>
          <p class="font-ko text-sm text-[var(--muted)] mt-3">평양에서도, 광화문 청동상에서도. 양쪽이 이미 공유하는 인물.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Center: Primary portrait, bust as unifying pillar -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-5 relative min-h-[380px] border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-[var(--rule)] reveal reveal-delay-1 overflow-hidden">
        <figure class="absolute inset-0">
          <img
            src="/images/admiral/yi-sun-sin-bust.jpg"
            alt="Bronze bust of Admiral Yi Sun-sin, uniting pillar claimed by both sides of the peninsula"
            width="1200"
            height="1400"
            loading="lazy"
            class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover object-[50%_22%]"
            style="filter: contrast(1.18) grayscale(0.28);"
          />
          <!-- refined print frame treatment (no crosshair targets) -->
          <div class="absolute inset-0 border border-[var(--rule)] pointer-events-none"></div>
          <div class="absolute inset-[3px] border border-[var(--rule)]/40 pointer-events-none"></div>
        </figure>

        <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 bg-[var(--paper)]/95 border-t border-[var(--rule)] p-4 sm:p-5 text-[0.65rem] font-mono-ui tracking-[0.08em] flex flex-wrap gap-x-4 gap-y-1 text-[var(--muted)]">
          <span>1545-1598</span>
          <span class="text-[var(--hazard)]">23 · 0</span>
          <span>MYEONGNYANG 13 v 330</span>
          <span>SOVEREIGN · NO SUBSIDY</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Right: Four masts / pillars of claim -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-3 blueprint-grid grid-cols-1 reveal reveal-delay-2 text-[0.8rem]">
        <article class="cell border-b border-[var(--rule)]/60">
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-1.5">
            <samp class="font-mono-ui text-[var(--hazard)]">KOREA</samp>
            <span class="font-mono-ui text-[10px] text-[var(--muted)]">BOTH</span>
          </div>
          <div class="font-macro text-[15px] leading-none mb-1">One peninsula</div>
          <div class="font-ko text-[10px] text-[var(--muted)] mb-2">하나의 반도</div>
          <p class="text-[11px] leading-snug">Five thousand years. One language. One lineage. North and south of the line.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="cell border-b border-[var(--rule)]/60">
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-1.5">
            <samp class="font-mono-ui text-[var(--hazard)]">CANADA</samp>
            <span class="font-mono-ui text-[10px] text-[var(--muted)]">KC-01</span>
          </div>
          <div class="font-macro text-[15px] leading-none mb-1">Pacific corridor</div>
          <div class="font-ko text-[10px] text-[var(--muted)] mb-2">태평양 회랑</div>
          <p class="text-[11px] leading-snug">Victoria’s Johnson Street Bridge to the peninsula. Diaspora and infrastructure aligned.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="cell">
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between mb-1.5">
            <samp class="font-mono-ui text-[var(--hazard)]">HERITAGE</samp>
            <span class="font-mono-ui text-[10px] text-[var(--muted)]">23-0</span>
          </div>
          <div class="font-macro text-[15px] leading-none mb-1">The record</div>
          <div class="font-ko text-[10px] text-[var(--muted)] mb-2">난중일기 · 23전 23승</div>
          <p class="text-[11px] leading-snug">Undefeated at sea. No foreign subsidy. The precedent both Koreas already carry.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Kintsugi unity strip + bridge link (award craft detail row) -->
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 border-x border-t border-[var(--rule)]">
      <div class="cell flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-5 items-center border-b md:border-b-0 md:border-r border-[var(--rule)]">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-full sm:w-40">
          <img 
            src="/images/admiral/kintsugi-unity.jpg" 
            alt="Kintsugi bowl, the mended vessel, metaphor for a peninsula repaired yet stronger in its seams"
            width="640" 
            height="480"
            loading="lazy"
            class="w-full h-auto border border-[var(--rule)] object-cover"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="text-[0.8rem]">
          <div class="font-mono-ui text-[10px] text-[var(--hazard)] mb-1">METAPHOR</div>
          <p class="leading-snug">What is broken can be repaired with gold. The seams become the strength. One people. The die is cast.</p>
          <p class="font-ko text-[var(--muted)] text-xs mt-1">깨진 것은 금으로 이어진다. 그 이음새가 힘이 된다.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="cell flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-5 items-center">
        <div class="shrink-0 w-full sm:w-40">
          <img 
            src="/images/admiral/johnson-street-bridge.jpg" 
            alt="Johnson Street Bridge, Victoria BC, the Canadian anchor of the Pacific corridor"
            width="640" 
            height="360"
            loading="lazy"
            class="w-full h-auto border border-[var(--rule)] object-cover"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="text-[0.8rem]">
          <div class="font-mono-ui text-[10px] text-[var(--hazard)] mb-1">CORRIDOR</div>
          <p class="leading-snug">Victoria, BC. The bridge that faces the Pacific. Same conviction that built turtle ships now builds the corridor.</p>
          <p class="font-ko text-[var(--muted)] text-xs mt-1">빅토리아. 태평양을 향한 다리. 거북선을 만든 그 확신이 이제 회랑을 만든다.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>